    a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Scope of Services" ;
    skos:definition "Services that are offered range throughout the value chain, and can include automation or centralisation of common services. Services should be documented and appropriate. Pre-deposit services include QA and FAIR improvement, linking to DMPs, format conversions, etc. Value-added services include linking to tools, citation indices, and SKGs." .

